00:06:31.824 --> 00:06:33.426
Mainstream won't cover it.

00:06:33.426 --> 00:06:35.027
And then it makes it
a little hard to see,

00:06:35.027 --> 00:06:36.562 align:start size:84% position:16%
well, what is the
average person seeing?

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:37.964 align:start size:84% position:16%
Do they even know what
they're voting on,

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:39.432
'cause they're not seeing it,

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.567
depending on what
news they watch?

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.403
- Well, I will tell you
that you talk to people

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:45.805 align:start size:97% position:3%
down here in Texas, and
especially you talk to people

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.440 align:start size:88% position:13%
on the border counties,
they will tell you

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.242
that's the number one thing.

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:52.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that it really
came to a forefront,

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:55.448 align:start size:97% position:3%
nationally as an issue,
when we saw those airplanes

00:06:55.448 --> 00:06:56.916
that landed in the
middle of the night

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.818
in Westchester County, New York,

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:00.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
that had illegal
immigrant minor children,

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:02.588 align:start size:84% position:16%
and those planes
took off from Texas.

00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:04.257 align:start size:84% position:16%
And we also know that
there were planes

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:05.558 align:start size:84% position:16%
that had been
landing in Florida,

00:07:05.558 --> 00:07:08.060
where I think you may
be looking to come,

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.629
and we want you to
come here to Texas,

00:07:09.629 --> 00:07:11.264
don't want you to go to Florida.

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.433
- Uh oh, who told you to
make the hard sell, man?

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:14.967 align:start size:81% position:19%
Uh oh, uh oh.
- I'm trying, man.

00:07:14.967 --> 00:07:17.036
I'm gonna make you an
offer you can't refuse.

00:07:17.036 --> 00:07:20.106 align:start size:97% position:3%
But you know, we seen those
planes land in Florida.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:22.108
We seen those planes
land in Tennessee.

00:07:22.108 --> 00:07:24.911 align:start size:84% position:16%
And how interesting,
those planes are
landing in red states.

00:07:24.911 --> 00:07:26.746 align:start size:88% position:13%
Those planes are landing
