00:07:37.857 --> 00:07:40.193 align:start size:88% position:13%
And where is that coming
from? The fentanyl.

00:07:40.193 --> 00:07:41.494 align:start size:84% position:16%
And how has fentanyl
getting into

00:07:41.494 --> 00:07:42.962
