00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:45.164 align:start size:97% position:3%
From China, down in Mexico,
across the border here.

00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:47.300
So we've got a drug
trafficking crisis.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.735 align:start size:88% position:13%
We have a human and
sex trafficking crisis.

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:52.038
Texas is the number
one state in America

00:07:52.038 --> 00:07:55.107 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
