sex trafficking.

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:04.283
And we know about the
public health crisis.

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:05.551
Think about this, Dave,

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.019
I mean we've got a
federal government

00:08:07.019 --> 00:08:10.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's telling us, law
abiding American citizens,

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:13.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
