00:08:17.063 --> 00:08:18.564
and no one is telling them

00:08:18.564 --> 00:08:20.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
they have to have anything
injected in their body.

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:22.301 align:start size:84% position:16%
So we have a public
health crisis as well.

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:25.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Were you beyond shocked,
when about a week ago,

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:27.507
maybe 10 days ago,
when Anthony Fauci

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:29.408
